Description:
    Implements allocation scoring rules for evaluating probabilistic forecasts.
    Given forecasts for several targets and a shared resource budget, an
    allocation is computed by minimizing expected generalized piecewise linear
    loss subject to the budget constraint, and forecasts are scored by the
    realized loss of that allocation relative to the loss of an allocation made
    by an oracle that knew the observed outcomes. Model output and observed
    data are read in the formats used by the hubverse.
